
---
import DocsLayout from '/src/layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
import DocsCode from '/src/components/DocsCode.astro';
---

<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-constant">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ZERO_VECTOR: vector = <0.0, 0.0, 0.0>`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`vector ZERO_VECTOR = <0.0, 0.0, 0.0>;`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>The vector constant ZERO_VECTOR has the value &lt;0.0, 0.0, 0.0&gt;</p>
  <p>The default value for a variable of vector type.</p>
</p>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Tech Specs</div>

      <div class="label-stack">
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
  <h2>Notes</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Is treated like <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/FALSE" target="_blank">FALSE</a> in <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Conditional" target="_blank">conditionals</a>.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Deep Notes</h2>
  <p>Shares the same value with <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/TOUCH_INVALID_VECTOR" target="_blank">TOUCH_INVALID_VECTOR</a>.</p>
  <p><a href="https://secondlife.canny.io/?search=ZERO_VECTOR" target="_blank">Search Canny for related Issues</a></p>
  <table>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <th>Signature</th>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><div class="lua-block"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`
ZERO_VECTOR = vector(0.0, 0.0, 0.0)
`} lang="slua" /></div>
<div class="lsl-block"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`
vector ZERO_VECTOR = <0.0, 0.0, 0.0>;
`} lang="lsl" /></div>

</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

</DocsLayout>
      